# Python bytecode & caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Tests (not needed in production image)
**/test
**/tests

# IDE & OS
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Git metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Documentation & non-code files
**/LICENSE
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/*.ipynb

# Build artifacts
**/build
**/dist
**/.eggs
